              "lines": [
                "Noa safinani akatuma kunguru nenda ukaone maji kama yamepunguka, sikilizeni eh kunguru akatoka tazameni eh \" Tazama kunguru akenda kuketi yoyoyo akenda kuzunguruka (wajoli ) hakupenda kurudi \"2x"
