              "lines": [
                "Zambi wa kamba noa songa bwatu kofere (ikale) ikale mutshi wa bwato uwenzele nzumbu munda mikese isatu mu bwatu.",
                "SOURCE_BLOCK",
                "njonii (njoni kua yesu) njoni uchukuwe nawe nira yangu hii, (nira yangu hii) nira yani musalaba. 2x"
