              "type": "refrain",
              "lines": [
                "Mwishi wetu (Saka bwatu pa moyi enza mujimu wa nzambi papa wanyi enza mudjimu eu ujikija) 2x",
                "- Noa wetu: saka bwatu pa mayi enza mujimu wa nzambi papa wanyi enza mudjimu eu ujikija",
